{"speciesId":261,"names":{"fr":"Medhyèna","es":"Poochyena","en":"Poochyena","ja":"ポチエナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"At first sight, POOCHYENA takes a bite at anything that moves. This POKéMON chases after prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it may turn tail if the prey strikes back."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"POOCHYENA is an omnivore - it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This POKéMON tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It chases its prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it turns tail if the prey strikes back."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It chases its prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it turns tail if the prey strikes back."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon très obstiné qui poursuit sa proie jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit épuisée."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon très obstiné qui poursuit sa proie jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit épuisée."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon très obstiné qui poursuit sa proie jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit épuisée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es muy persistente. Si se fija en una presa, no la dejará hasta que caiga agotada."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"しつこい 性格の ポケモン。 目をつけた 獲物が ヘトヘトに 疲れるまで 追いかけ回す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Medhyèna est d’un tempérament tenace. Son odorat très développé lui permet de ne jamais perdre la trace de sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es tenaz por naturaleza. Tiene un sentido del olfato tan agudo que nunca se le escapa la presa que quiere."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鋭い きゅうかくで ねらった 獲物は 絶対に 逃がさない。 とっても しつこい 性格だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sans se poser de questions, Medhyèna essaie de mordre tout ce qui bouge. Ce Pokémon pourchasse sa proie jusqu’à ce qu’elle s’épuise. Cependant, il se peut qu’il prenne peur et s’enfuie si la proie riposte."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La primera reacción que Poochyena tiene al ver algo moverse es darle un mordisco. Este Pokémon persigue a su presa hasta que cae agotada. Aunque, a veces, sale huyendo si su presa le responde con un ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"At first sight, Poochyena takes a bite at anything that moves. This Pokémon chases after prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it may turn tail if the prey strikes back."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"動く ものを 見つけると すぐに かみつく。 獲物が ヘトヘトに なるまで 追いかけ回すが 反撃されると 尻ごみする ことも あるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Medhyèna est omnivore. Il mange de tout. Ses crocs sont très gros, comparés à son corps. Ce Pokémon essaie d’intimider ses ennemis en hérissant les poils de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Poochyena es un Pokémon omnívoro. Se come lo que sea. Le caracteriza el gran tamaño de sus colmillos respecto al resto del cuerpo. Este Pokémon hace que se le erice la cola para intentar intimidar a su rival."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Poochyena is an omnivore—it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This Pokémon tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"なんでも 食べる 雑食性の ポケモン。 体に 比べ 大きな キバが 特徴。 尻尾の 毛を 逆立てて 敵を 威嚇する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":261,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[23,"level-up",7],[25,"level-up",7]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0],[23,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up"